        "gglYV86e4fi_text": "<strong>8 Ingredients. 3 Root Causes. </strong><span style=\"color:#54B94A;\"><strong>1 Powerful Formula.</strong></span>",
        "ggf86iodwdO_text": "<p>CLINICALLY DOSED + EFFECTIVE</p><p>Every ingredient at a dose backed by peer-reviewed clinical research. Zero proprietary blends. Zero filler. 100% transparent label.</p>",
