        "ggkPCcm-ToX_text": "<p>Third-Party Tested By ISO 17025 Accredited Labs</p>",
        "ggsUZpPcoJZ_text": "<p>Backed by 100+ scientific studies&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggw5Zt0ZNEy_childItem_0": "<p>Core Foundation</p>",
        "gge33JFbE0Z_childItem_0": "<p>SHILAJIT - 150mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Asphaltum punjabianum Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggnYTel283__text": "<p>Delivers 85+ trace minerals and fulvic acid directly to mitochondria for cellular energy production</p>",
        "ggB7NLniZM__childItem_0": "<p>Optimizer</p>",
        "ggZLntyeZzR_childItem_0": "<p>ASHWAGANDHA - 20mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Withania somnifera Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggzZOsJc8VJ_text": "<p>Reduces cortisol interference and supports stress adaptation so energy pathways stay open</p>",
        "ggmoxnB6Ppc_childItem_0": "<p>Amplifier</p>",
        "ggpqha2_gKe_childItem_0": "<p>GINGER - 5mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Zingiber officinale Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggMJU8MiB9j_text": "<p>Enhances absorption of all other herbs by up to 200%+ through digestive optimization</p>",
        "gg3h7ZWpkW8_childItem_0": "<p>Vitality Tonic</p>",
        "gghJAgRIrJl_childItem_0": "<p>BLACK MUSLI - 3mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Curculigo orchioides Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggqOrULU3cT_text": "<p>Traditional Ayurvedic adaptogen supporting physical endurance and sustained vitality</p>",
        "ggFtXCv0qrI_childItem_0": "<p>Supporter</p>",
        "ggn1r6balq9_childItem_0": "<p>GOKSHURA - 3mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Tribulus terrestris Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggJtHnWPQl0_text": "<p>Supports natural testosterone production and athletic performance in men</p>",
        "ggKNSoEHfrh_childItem_0": "<p>Mood Enhancer</p>",
        "ggtQs4SA7DU_childItem_0": "<p>KAUNCH - 3mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Mucuna pruriens Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggy3JvfV0Yv_text": "<p>Natural L-DOPA source supporting dopamine production for motivation and mental drive</p>",
        "gg4LbD-Xr5Q_childItem_0": "<p>Endurance Adaptogen</p>",
        "ggzb5yWwwW0_childItem_0": "<p>GINSENG - 2mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Panax ginseng Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggw1YB_v0mU_text": "<p>Time-tested adaptogen for sustained energy, mental clarity, and physical endurance</p>",
        "ggPpKmG79EN_childItem_0": "<p>Nerve Tonic</p>",
        "gg89EsUPvne_childItem_0": "<p>AKARKARA - 2mg<span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Anacyclus pyrethrum Extract</i></span></p>",
        "gg8arKf5TuJ_text": "<p>Traditional rejuvenating herb supporting nervous system function and overall vitality</p>",
        "ggCYQu6c7Q5_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">🔥 <strong>TESTOSTERONE + ENERGY</strong></span></p>",
        "ggdWG0pL2wa_childItem_0": "<p>SHILAJIT - 150mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Asphaltum punjabianum Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggETQ82qGFJ_text": "<p>Ancient Himalayan compound clinically shown to support T-production, cellular energy via CoQ10 &amp; fulvic acid, and male fertility markers.</p>",
        "ggNv9XtxFud_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>🛡 CORTISOL + STRESS</strong></span></p>",
        "ggl--Jod6ZX_childItem_0": "<p>ASHWAGANDHA - 20mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Withania somnifera Extract</i></span></p>",
        "gg-tL7NX2hU_text": "<p>Clinically shown to reduce cortisol by up to 27.9%. When stress drops, blood flow opens, drive returns, performance anxiety fades. The foundation of the formula.</p>",
        "gg1-Giz2XVk_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>🌊 BLOOD FLOW + ANTI-INFLAMMATION</strong></span></p>",
        "ggWmpbW72Ig_childItem_0": "<p>GINGER - 5mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Zingiber officinale Extract</i></span></p>",
        "gg8xGNIaDQ2_text": "<p>More than a kitchen spice. Ginger supports healthy blood circulation, reduces oxidative stress, and helps regulate inflammation - the silent saboteur behind fatigue, sluggish recovery, and declining performance. Research suggests ginger may also support healthy testosterone levels and improve markers of male reproductive health.</p>",
        "ggqZ89J3HX2_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>🔥 TESTOSTERONE + VITALITY</strong></span></p>",
        "ggOBYtBpGa8_childItem_0": "<p>BLACK MUSLI - 3mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Curculigo orchioides Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggQJXO8lXZF_text": "<p>One of Ayurveda's most revered vitality herbs. Black Musli is traditionally used to support male strength, stamina, and reproductive health. Modern research points to its adaptogenic and antioxidant properties — helping the body resist stress-related decline while supporting healthy testosterone and sustained physical energy.</p>",
        "gg6xMqa_fF1_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>🔒 FREE TESTOSTERONE</strong></span></p>",
        "ggLymU7k6wY_childItem_0": "<p>GOKSHURA - 3mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Tribulus terrestris Extract</i></span></p>",
        "gg0ElNji-YA_text": "<p>Supports natural testosterone production and helps increase \"free\" (bioavailable) testosterone. Enhances physical performance, recovery, and circulation. Used in Ayurvedic medicine for centuries.</p>",
        "gg4Ks8yBG8g_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>⚡️ DOPAMINE + DRIVE</strong></span></p>",
        "ggj5dD4nOzL_childItem_0": "<p>KAUNCH - 3mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Mucuna pruriens Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggxMln8fnGB_text": "<p>Your brain's missing link. Kaunch is a natural source of L-DOPA — the direct precursor to dopamine, the neurotransmitter behind motivation, pleasure, and drive. When dopamine is low, nothing feels worth the effort — the gym, the relationship, the goals. Kaunch supports healthy dopamine production while also promoting healthy testosterone and stress resilience. This is the ingredient that makes you <i>want</i> to show up again.</p>",
        "gguPhs4krTD_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>🍆 BLOOD FLOW + ENDURANCE</strong></span></p>",
        "ggQwgTzS5Da_childItem_0": "<p>GINSENG - 2mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Panax ginseng Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggzksddkMwR_text": "<p>Used for over 2,000 years across Eastern medicine for a reason. Ginseng enhances nitric oxide production for improved circulation, supports sustained physical and mental energy without the crash, and helps the body adapt to stress. Clinical research links ginseng to improved endurance, sharper cognitive function, and enhanced male performance markers. The endurance engine of the formula.</p>",
        "ggtwSkMHhFt_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>💦 DRIVE + PERFORMANCE</strong></span></p>",
        "ggyEWqDOwwJ_childItem_0": "<p>AKARKARA - 2mg</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><i>Anacyclus pyrethrum Extract</i></span></p>",
        "ggIWI40HBpr_text": "<p>The ingredient most men have never heard of — and the one they feel fastest. Akarkara is a potent Ayurvedic herb traditionally used to support male vigor, nerve stimulation, and physical performance. It works by promoting healthy blood flow to the areas that matter most while supporting testosterone activity and stamina. Research suggests it enhances bioavailability of other herbs in the formula — making everything else work harder.</p>",
        "ggwi4WpNzDy_text": "<p>🏭 cGMP Facility</p>",
        "ggL23DrIVXo_text": "<p>🚫 Hormone-Free</p>",
        "ggQd1Lyzrha_text": "<p>🌱 Non-GMO</p>",
        "gg6-55oEDn7_text": "<p>🌿 Vegan</p>",
        "ggDdcsKf-kL_text": "<p>🔬 Third Party Tested</p>",
        "ggYxWlNow0U_text": "<p>🇺🇸 Formulated in USA</p>",
