      "type": "gp-section-606395141423039062",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "38e1df6321c7fc19103b91287e8567e40e3ec0c5d35ad23288bb22ba39ef1590_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg2Oscwl-W8_text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_0": "<p>How is Wellness Nest different from other Shilajit supplements?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_1": "<p>How long until I see results?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_2": "<p>Are there any side effects?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_3": "<p>Can I take it with medications?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_4": "<p>What if it doesn't work for me?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_5": "<p>Is my order discreet?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_6": "<p>How many gummies do I take per day?&nbsp;</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_7": "<p>Can this help with performance issues in the bedroom?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_8": "<p>How does this compare to TRT?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_9": "<p>I've tried other T-boosters and they didn't work. Why is this different?</p>",
        "gg2KTdZ8tfI_childItem_10": "<p>Is this FDA-approved?</p>",
        "gg4a8x2zCkC_text": "<p>Wellness Nest uses &nbsp;an 8-herb synergy system featuring Shilajit, Ashwagandha, Ginger, Black Musli, Gokshura, Kaunch, Ginseng, and Akarkara designed to maximize absorption. Standard mega-dose supplements lose up to 85% of their potency in digestion.</p>",
        "ggRqXQmTkxv_text": "<p>Most men report improved energy and sleep quality within the first 7-10 days (Phase 1: Adjustment). The \"Activation\" phase where drive, morning energy, and performance begin returning typically starts Weeks 3-4. Full optimization - sustained energy, stronger performance, visible body composition changes - by Weeks 8-12 with consistent daily use.</p>",
        "ggjhL2ttWiu_text": "<p>Wellness Nest is 100% natural, non-GMO, vegan, and third-party tested by Light Labs (Dec 2025). All ingredients are well-studied and generally well-tolerated. Some men experience mild digestive adjustment in the first 2-3 days as their body adapts.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you’re on prescription medication, consult your doctor before starting any new supplement. Our Medical Advisory Board includes a board-certified physician who oversees the formula’s safety profile.</p>",
        "ggrHHYhxxS4_text": "<p>If you're on blood thinners, blood pressure medication, or diabetes medication, please consult your healthcare provider first.</p>",
        "ggJbZr565_u_text": "<p>We offer a 90-day \"Feel The Difference\" guarantee. Full refund, no questions asked, even if the bottle is empty.</p>",
        "ggmO4sNTttZ_text": "<p>Yes! All orders ship in plain, unmarked packaging.</p>",
        "ggj94gSfnLk_text": "<p>2 gummies daily, preferably in the morning or 30 minutes before physical activity. Some men take it 1 hour before workouts for enhanced performance. Consistency matters more than timing - just make it part of your daily routine.</p>",
        "ggt9J3eiNJL_text": "<p>Wellness Nest addresses the three most common root causes behind declining male performance: elevated cortisol (which constricts blood flow and suppresses arousal signals), restricted circulation, and falling testosterone. By supporting all three systems naturally, most men report significant improvements in drive, stamina, and confidence. 91% of surveyed customers reported stronger drive within 60 days. This is not a band-aid — it’s a root-cause protocol that restores the systems responsible for performance.*</p>",
        "ggzan9FyD7M_text": "<p>TRT works by injecting synthetic testosterone, which shuts down your body’s own production. Once you start, your natural system atrophies - stopping is difficult because your body forgot how to make its own. Side effects include testicular atrophy, mood swings, acne, potential blood clot risk, fertility impairment, required blood monitoring every 3-6 months, and costs of $250+/month.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wellness Nest takes the opposite approach: it supports your body’s OWN testosterone production using 6 natural ingredients. No injections. No dependency. No shutdown. No required monitoring. And a fraction of the cost. See our comparison table for the full breakdown.</p>",
        "gg0Vh0lmi1l_text": "<p>Most T-boosters only target ONE system - usually testosterone. But if your cortisol is elevated (crushing energy) and your blood flow is restricted (limiting circulation), raising testosterone alone won’t solve the problem. It’s a one-system fix for a three-system problem.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Wellness Nest is a 8-in-1 formula that addresses all three root causes simultaneously: cortisol (Ashwagandha), blood flow (Black Maca), and testosterone production (Shilajit, Gokshura, Zinc, Fenugreek). That’s why men who failed on single-ingredient supplements see results with this formula.</p>",
        "ggS--5w4SSm_text": "<p>Like all dietary supplements in the United States, Wellness Nest is manufactured in an FDA-registered, cGMP-certified facility. The FDA does not approve dietary supplements in the same way it approves drugs. However, our facility undergoes regular FDA inspections, and every batch is third-party tested for purity, potency, and safety by Light Labs.</p>"
      }
    },
    "gp_section_606395141423104598": {
      "type": "gp-section-606395141423104598",
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "5acac2181d2871165d392224aa4f0a4d51fd586e52e9f170ae27c411b4da31f0_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggY41n2o-TO_text": "<p><strong>THE REAL PROBLEM</strong></p>",
        "ggwkynPz5gr_text": "<strong>It’s Not Just Age. Your Libido, Drive, Energy &amp; Bedroom Confidence </strong><span style=\"color:#54B94A;\"><strong>Are Fading After 30.</strong></span>",
        "ggR3mdbHPDa_text": "<p>You know this feeling all too well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You used to have energy that lasted well past 2pm. Drive that showed up naturally. Strength that didn’t fade halfway through a workout. Confidence that made you feel unstoppable — especially in the bedroom.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Now? You’re dragging through the day on caffeine. Your workouts feel flat and heavy. Motivation is slipping. The drive and libido you once took for granted have quietly disappeared.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And in the bedroom? Let’s be honest — you’re not performing like you used to. You feel it. She feels it.&nbsp;</p><p>And it’s quietly affecting your confidence.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You keep telling yourself it’s just stress. Just age. Just a phase.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s not.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It’s your body’s three core performance systems breaking down at the same time.</p>",
        "ggmSFapMRGm_text": "<p>❌ <strong>SYSTEM 1: CORTISOL&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>OVERDRIVE</strong></p>",
        "gg-9T7eLkbh_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Stress hormones stay elevated, crushing your energy, restricting blood flow, and suppressing testosterone production at the source.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Result: constant fatigue, brain fog, and fading drive.</span></p>",
        "ggB5fHYY213_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">❌ <strong>SYSTEM 2: BLOOD FLOW&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>RESTRICTION</strong></span></p>",
        "ggTHPrqJzfz_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Nitric oxide levels drop. Circulation weakens to your muscles, brain, and everywhere that matters - including the bedroom.&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Performance becomes inconsistent and unreliable.</span></p>",
        "ggYvahvjpEs_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">❌ <strong>SYSTEM 3: TESTOSTERONE&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><strong>DECLINE</strong></span></p>",
        "gg9yDfKWRMv_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">After 30, testosterone drops 1-2% every year. By 40, most men have lost 10-20% of their peak levels. Strength, libido, confidence, and recovery all follow it down.</span></p>",
        "gg3Vug87ntI_text": "<p>Most men try to fix just one system - a T-booster here, more caffeine there, or sheer willpower.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>But when all three systems are failing together, fixing one barely makes a difference.</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>You need to restore all three at once.</strong></p>"
      }
    },
